[0.1.2]
* Update Headscale to 0.29.6 with upstream security fixes and peer-map performance improvements.
* Update the pinned Cloudron base to 6.0.1 with its patched CA bundle.
* Minimum supported Tailscale client remains 1.80.0.

[0.1.1]
* Link the Cloudron forum topic for questions and feedback.
* No change to the app; Headscale is still 0.29.5.

[0.1.0]
* Initial Cloudron package for Headscale 0.29.5.
* Sign in with Cloudron (OIDC) when adding devices; pre-auth keys for headless devices.
* Embedded DERP relay over HTTPS, with STUN on UDP 3480 by default.
* SQLite database, keys and config.yaml in /app/data, included in backups.
